{"seq":2,"slug":"classes-mixins-extensions","title":"类、Mixin 与扩展","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/type-system/classes-mixins-extensions","wordCount":1370,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"类-mixin-与扩展\">类、Mixin 与扩展</h1><p>Dart 3.0 引入的类修饰符（Class Modifiers）让面向对象设计从「一切皆可继承」的混沌状态进入了精确控制的时代——开发者可以用 <code>base</code>、<code>interface</code>、<code>final</code>、<code>sealed</code> 四个关键字声明一个类型允许被如何使用。结合 Dart 2.7 的扩展方法和 Dart 3.3 的扩展类型，Dart 的类型组合能力已形成完整的矩阵。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇要建立的几张底牌，是读懂后续所有组合技的前提：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>一句话定义</th>\n<th>在本篇中的角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>类修饰符</td>\n<td><code>base</code>/<code>interface</code>/<code>final</code>/<code>sealed</code> 声明类型的使用边界</td>\n<td>把「一切皆可继承」收紧为契约</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sealed</code></td>\n<td>子类型同库封闭，编译器可验证 switch 穷尽性</td>\n<td>Dart 对代数数据类型的回答</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mixin</td>\n<td>不建立继承关系而注入行为的代码复用机制</td>\n<td>横切关注点的组合单元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C3 线性化</td>\n<td>Mixin 方法解析按线性化顺序，后声明者优先</td>\n<td>mixin 组合的语义规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>extension</code> 方法</td>\n<td>纯静态分发、零运行时开销的便利方法</td>\n<td>为不可修改的类型加功能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>extension type</code></td>\n<td>编译期新类型、运行时完全擦除的零成本包装</td>\n<td>制造类型安全的 ID 视图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话串起来：修饰符决定一个类型「能被怎么用」，<code>sealed</code> 把这种控制升级为穷尽匹配保证，mixin 负责横向组合行为，两种 extension 负责在不改原类型的前提下扩展能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"类修饰符矩阵\">类修饰符矩阵</h2><p>Dart 3.0 的类修饰符系统用四个正交维度控制类的使用方式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>修饰符</th>\n<th>可构造</th>\n<th>可继承（extends）</th>\n<th>可实现（implements）</th>\n<th>可 with（mixin）</th>\n<th>适用范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>class</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>默认：完全开放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>base class</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>保护实现细节</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>interface class</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>纯契约定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>final class</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>完全封闭</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sealed class</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>同库内</td>\n<td>同库内</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>代数数据类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>abstract class</code></td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>抽象基类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>mixin class</code></td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>同时可做 mixin</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[class 声明] --&gt; B{需要限制吗?}&#10;    B --&gt;|不限制| C[class]&#10;    B --&gt;|禁止 implements| D[base class]&#10;    B --&gt;|禁止 extends| E[interface class]&#10;    B --&gt;|全部禁止| F[final class]&#10;    B --&gt;|穷尽匹配| G[sealed class]&#10;    G --&gt; H[子类 1]&#10;    G --&gt; I[子类 2]&#10;    G --&gt; J[子类 N]\">graph TD\n    A[class 声明] --&gt; B{需要限制吗?}\n    B --&gt;|不限制| C[class]\n    B --&gt;|禁止 implements| D[base class]\n    B --&gt;|禁止 extends| E[interface class]\n    B --&gt;|全部禁止| F[final class]\n    B --&gt;|穷尽匹配| G[sealed class]\n    G --&gt; H[子类 1]\n    G --&gt; I[子类 2]\n    G --&gt; J[子类 N]</pre><p>选择修饰符的核心原则：<strong>默认用 <code>final</code>，需要继承时放宽到 <code>base</code>，需要多态替换时用 <code>interface</code>，需要编译期穷尽检查时用 <code>sealed</code></strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sealed-类与代数数据类型\">sealed 类与代数数据类型</h2><p><code>sealed</code> 类是 Dart 对代数数据类型（ADT）的回答。编译器知道所有 <code>sealed</code> 类的子类型，因此能在 <code>switch</code> 表达式中强制穷尽性检查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"sealed class Shape {}&#10;final class Circle extends Shape {&#10;  final double radius;&#10;  Circle(this.radius);&#10;}&#10;final class Rectangle extends Shape {&#10;  final double width, height;&#10;  Rectangle(this.width, this.height);&#10;}&#10;final class Triangle extends Shape {&#10;  final double base, height;&#10;  Triangle(this.base, this.height);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 编译器保证穷尽：漏掉任何子类型都会报错&#10;double area(Shape shape) =&gt; switch (shape) {&#10;  Circle(radius: var r) =&gt; 3.14159 * r * r,&#10;  Rectangle(:var width, :var height) =&gt; width * height,&#10;  Triangle(:var base, :var height) =&gt; 0.5 * base * height,&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>sealed class Shape {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class Circle extends Shape {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final double radius;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Circle(this.radius);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class Rectangle extends Shape {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final double width, height;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Rectangle(this.width, this.height);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class Triangle extends Shape {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final double base, height;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Triangle(this.base, this.height);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 编译器保证穷尽：漏掉任何子类型都会报错</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>double area(Shape shape) => switch (shape) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Circle(radius: var r) => 3.14159 * r * r,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Rectangle(:var width, :var height) => width * height,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Triangle(:var base, :var height) => 0.5 * base * height,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><p>面积公式可表示为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>π</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Circle</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Rectangle</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>b</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>Triangle</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = \\begin{cases} \\pi r^2 &amp; \\text{Circle} \\\\ w \\times h &amp; \\text{Rectangle} \\\\ \\frac{1}{2} b \\times h &amp; \\text{Triangle} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:4.32em;vertical-align:-1.91em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.35em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎩</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.192em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.15em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎨</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.292em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span style=\"height:0.316em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"0.316em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 316\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V316 H384z M384 0 H504 V316 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.6em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.15em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎧</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.85em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.41em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Circle</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.97em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Rectangle</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.53em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Triangle</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.91em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><code>sealed</code> 类的约束条件：所有直接子类型必须在<strong>同一个库</strong>内定义。这意味着外部包无法添加新的子类型，保证了模式匹配的穷尽性在编译期始终成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mixin-的组合模型\">Mixin 的组合模型</h2><p>Dart 的 mixin 是一种<strong>无状态假设</strong>的代码复用机制——它允许在不建立继承关系的前提下，将行为注入到类中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"mixin Serializable {&#10;  Map&lt;String, dynamic&gt; toJson();&#10;&#10;  String toJsonString() =&gt; jsonEncode(toJson());&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  String toString() =&gt; toJsonString();&#10;}&#10;&#10;mixin Validatable {&#10;  List&lt;String&gt; validate();&#10;&#10;  bool get isValid =&gt; validate().isEmpty;&#10;&#10;  void assertValid() {&#10;    final errors = validate();&#10;    if (errors.isNotEmpty) {&#10;      throw ValidationException(errors);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 组合多个 mixin：线性化顺序决定方法解析&#10;class UserModel with Serializable, Validatable {&#10;  final String name;&#10;  final String email;&#10;&#10;  UserModel({required this.name, required this.email});&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  Map&lt;String, dynamic&gt; toJson() =&gt; {&#39;name&#39;: name, &#39;email&#39;: email};&#10;&#10;  @override&#10;  List&lt;String&gt; validate() =&gt; [&#10;    if (name.isEmpty) &#39;Name cannot be empty&#39;,&#10;    if (!email.contains(&#39;@&#39;)) &#39;Invalid email format&#39;,&#10;  ];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>mixin Serializable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Map&#x3C;String, dynamic> toJson();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  String toJsonString() => jsonEncode(toJson());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  String toString() => toJsonString();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mixin Validatable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  List&#x3C;String> validate();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  bool get isValid => validate().isEmpty;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void assertValid() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    final errors = validate();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (errors.isNotEmpty) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      throw ValidationException(errors);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 组合多个 mixin：线性化顺序决定方法解析</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UserModel with Serializable, Validatable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String name;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String email;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  UserModel({required this.name, required this.email});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Map&#x3C;String, dynamic> toJson() => {'name': name, 'email': email};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  @override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  List&#x3C;String> validate() => [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (name.isEmpty) 'Name cannot be empty',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (!email.contains('@')) 'Invalid email format',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Mixin 的方法解析遵循<strong>C3 线性化</strong>算法。对于 <code>class A with M1, M2 extends B</code>，方法查找顺序是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>M</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>→</mo><mi>M</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>→</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\to M2 \\to M1 \\to B \\to Object</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">bj</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>。后声明的 mixin 优先级更高：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"mixin Logger {&#10;  void log(String msg) =&gt; print(&#39;[LOG] $msg&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;mixin DebugLogger {&#10;  void log(String msg) =&gt; print(&#39;[DEBUG ${DateTime.now()}] $msg&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// log() 调用将执行 DebugLogger.log（后声明者优先）&#10;class Service with Logger, DebugLogger {&#10;  void process() =&gt; log(&#39;Processing...&#39;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>mixin Logger {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void log(String msg) => print('[LOG] $msg');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mixin DebugLogger {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void log(String msg) => print('[DEBUG ${DateTime.now()}] $msg');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// log() 调用将执行 DebugLogger.log（后声明者优先）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Service with Logger, DebugLogger {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void process() => log('Processing...');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Dart 3.0 后，普通 <code>class</code> 不再能隐式用作 mixin。需要同时支持 <code>extends</code> 和 <code>with</code> 的类型必须显式声明为 <code>mixin class</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// Dart 3.0+：明确意图&#10;mixin class EventEmitter {&#10;  final _listeners = &lt;String, List&lt;Function&gt;&gt;{};&#10;&#10;  void on(String event, Function handler) {&#10;    _listeners.putIfAbsent(event, () =&gt; []).add(handler);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  void emit(String event, [dynamic data]) {&#10;    _listeners[event]?.forEach((h) =&gt; h(data));&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 既可以继承&#10;class WebSocket extends EventEmitter { /* ... */ }&#10;// 也可以作为 mixin&#10;class JsonParser with EventEmitter { /* ... */ }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Dart 3.0+：明确意图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mixin class EventEmitter {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final _listeners = &#x3C;String, List&#x3C;Function>>{};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void on(String event, Function handler) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _listeners.putIfAbsent(event, () => []).add(handler);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void emit(String event, [dynamic data]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _listeners[event]?.forEach((h) => h(data));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 既可以继承</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class WebSocket extends EventEmitter { /* ... */ }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 也可以作为 mixin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class JsonParser with EventEmitter { /* ... */ }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"扩展方法与扩展类型\">扩展方法与扩展类型</h2><p>Dart 提供两种「扩展」机制，用途截然不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>引入版本</th>\n<th>运行时开销</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>extension</code> 方法</td>\n<td>Dart 2.7</td>\n<td>零（纯静态分发）</td>\n<td>为已有类型添加便利方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>extension type</code></td>\n<td>Dart 3.3</td>\n<td>零（编译期擦除）</td>\n<td>零成本包装，创建新的类型视图</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>扩展方法为无法修改的类型添加功能，最常见于对 <code>String</code>、<code>Iterable</code> 等核心类型的增强：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"extension StringValidation on String {&#10;  bool get isEmail =&gt; RegExp(r&#39;^[\\w-.]+@[\\w-]+\\.\\w+$&#39;).hasMatch(this);&#10;  bool get isNumeric =&gt; double.tryParse(this) != null;&#10;  String truncate(int maxLength, {String suffix = &#39;...&#39;}) =&gt;&#10;      length &lt;= maxLength ? this : &#39;${substring(0, maxLength)}$suffix&#39;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;extension IterableStats on Iterable&lt;num&gt; {&#10;  double get mean =&gt; isEmpty ? 0 : fold&lt;num&gt;(0, (a, b) =&gt; a + b) / length;&#10;  num get max =&gt; reduce((a, b) =&gt; a &gt; b ? a : b);&#10;  num get min =&gt; reduce((a, b) =&gt; a &lt; b ? a : b);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>extension StringValidation on String {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  bool get isEmail => RegExp(r'^[\\w-.]+@[\\w-]+\\.\\w+$').hasMatch(this);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  bool get isNumeric => double.tryParse(this) != null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  String truncate(int maxLength, {String suffix = '...'}) =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      length &#x3C;= maxLength ? this : '${substring(0, maxLength)}$suffix';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>extension IterableStats on Iterable&#x3C;num> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  double get mean => isEmpty ? 0 : fold&#x3C;num>(0, (a, b) => a + b) / length;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  num get max => reduce((a, b) => a > b ? a : b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  num get min => reduce((a, b) => a &#x3C; b ? a : b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>扩展类型是 Dart 3.3 引入的<strong>零成本抽象</strong>——它在编译期创建一个新类型，但运行时完全擦除为底层表示类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 编译期是 UserId 类型，运行时是普通 String&#10;extension type UserId(String value) {&#10;  // 可以添加方法和 getter&#10;  bool get isValid =&gt; value.startsWith(&#39;usr_&#39;) &amp;&amp; value.length == 20;&#10;&#10;  // 可以定义构造函数&#10;  factory UserId.generate() =&gt; UserId(&#39;usr_${_randomString(16)}&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;extension type Port(int value) {&#10;  bool get isPrivileged =&gt; value &lt; 1024;&#10;  bool get isValid =&gt; value &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; value &lt;= 65535;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 类型安全：不能混淆 UserId 和普通 String&#10;void fetchUser(UserId id) { /* ... */ }&#10;// fetchUser(&#39;random-string&#39;); // 编译错误！&#10;fetchUser(UserId(&#39;usr_abc123def456xyz9&#39;));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 编译期是 UserId 类型，运行时是普通 String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>extension type UserId(String value) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 可以添加方法和 getter</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  bool get isValid => value.startsWith('usr_') &#x26;&#x26; value.length == 20;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 可以定义构造函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  factory UserId.generate() => UserId('usr_${_randomString(16)}');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>extension type Port(int value) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  bool get isPrivileged => value &#x3C; 1024;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  bool get isValid => value > 0 &#x26;&#x26; value &#x3C;= 65535;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 类型安全：不能混淆 UserId 和普通 String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>void fetchUser(UserId id) { /* ... */ }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// fetchUser('random-string'); // 编译错误！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fetchUser(UserId('usr_abc123def456xyz9'));</span></span></code></pre></div><p>扩展类型与 <code>typedef</code> 的区别：<code>typedef</code> 只是别名，不阻止类型混淆；扩展类型创建了真正独立的类型，编译器会阻止隐式转换。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dart-3-12-私有命名参数\">Dart 3.12 私有命名参数</h2><p>Dart 3.12（2026 年 5 月）引入的 <strong>private named parameters</strong> 解决了一个长期痛点——初始化私有字段时不再需要冗余的赋值代码：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// Dart 3.12 之前：需要手动在初始化列表中赋值&#10;class Point {&#10;  final int _x;&#10;  final int _y;&#10;  Point({required int x, required int y}) : _x = x, _y = y;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Dart 3.12：直接用初始化形参引用私有字段&#10;class Point {&#10;  final int _x;&#10;  final int _y;&#10;  Point({required this._x, required this._y});&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 调用时自动去掉下划线前缀&#10;final p = Point(x: 1, y: 2);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Dart 3.12 之前：需要手动在初始化列表中赋值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Point {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final int _x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final int _y;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Point({required int x, required int y}) : _x = x, _y = y;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Dart 3.12：直接用初始化形参引用私有字段</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class Point {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final int _x;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final int _y;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Point({required this._x, required this._y});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 调用时自动去掉下划线前缀</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final p = Point(x: 1, y: 2);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>编译器自动将参数名映射规则：<code>_fieldName</code> → 公开参数名 <code>fieldName</code>。这与 Kotlin 的主构造函数语法类似，但保持了 Dart 的命名参数风格。</p>\n<h2 id=\"类型组合设计模式\">类型组合设计模式</h2><p>将修饰符、mixin 和扩展类型组合使用，可以构建表达力极强的 API：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dart\" data-code=\"// 用 sealed + final 实现状态机&#10;sealed class ConnectionState {}&#10;final class Disconnected extends ConnectionState {}&#10;final class Connecting extends ConnectionState {&#10;  final DateTime startedAt;&#10;  Connecting(this.startedAt);&#10;}&#10;final class Connected extends ConnectionState {&#10;  final Duration latency;&#10;  Connected(this.latency);&#10;}&#10;final class Error extends ConnectionState {&#10;  final String message;&#10;  Error(this.message);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 用 mixin 注入横切关注点&#10;mixin Loggable {&#10;  String get logPrefix;&#10;  void log(String msg) =&gt; print(&#39;[$logPrefix] $msg&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 用 extension type 保证类型安全的 ID&#10;extension type ConnectionId(String value) {&#10;  factory ConnectionId.create() =&gt;&#10;      ConnectionId(DateTime.now().microsecondsSinceEpoch.toRadixString(36));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 用 sealed + final 实现状态机</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sealed class ConnectionState {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class Disconnected extends ConnectionState {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class Connecting extends ConnectionState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final DateTime startedAt;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Connecting(this.startedAt);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class Connected extends ConnectionState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final Duration latency;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Connected(this.latency);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>final class Error extends ConnectionState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  final String message;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Error(this.message);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用 mixin 注入横切关注点</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>mixin Loggable {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  String get logPrefix;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  void log(String msg) => print('[$logPrefix] $msg');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 用 extension type 保证类型安全的 ID</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>extension type ConnectionId(String value) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  factory ConnectionId.create() =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ConnectionId(DateTime.now().microsecondsSinceEpoch.toRadixString(36));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>类修饰符把继承控制从「全靠约定」变成编译器强制的契约：默认用 <code>final</code>，需要继承放宽到 <code>base</code>，需要多态替换用 <code>interface</code>，需要穷尽检查用 <code>sealed</code>。</li>\n<li><code>sealed</code> 类要求所有直接子类型同库定义，这是 switch 表达式能在编译期强制穷尽的前提，也是 Dart 表达代数数据类型的方式。</li>\n<li>Mixin 按 C3 线性化解析方法，后声明的 mixin 优先级更高；Dart 3.0 后普通 <code>class</code> 不再隐式可作 mixin，需要显式声明 <code>mixin class</code>。</li>\n<li><code>extension</code> 方法是纯静态分发，<code>extension type</code> 在编译期创建真正独立的新类型而运行时擦除——前者加便利方法，后者防类型混淆。</li>\n<li>Dart 3.12 的私有命名参数让初始化私有字段不再需要手写初始化列表，编译器自动完成 <code>_field</code> → <code>field</code> 的参数名映射。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参阅 <a href=\"sound-null-safety\">健全空安全与类型系统</a> 了解空安全如何约束类型继承，以及 <a href=\"pattern-matching-records\">模式匹配与 Records</a> 了解如何对 sealed 类进行穷尽模式匹配。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"类、Mixin 与扩展","id":"类-mixin-与扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"类修饰符矩阵","id":"类修饰符矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"sealed 类与代数数据类型","id":"sealed-类与代数数据类型"},{"level":2,"text":"Mixin 的组合模型","id":"mixin-的组合模型"},{"level":2,"text":"扩展方法与扩展类型","id":"扩展方法与扩展类型"},{"level":2,"text":"Dart 3.12 私有命名参数","id":"dart-3-12-私有命名参数"},{"level":2,"text":"类型组合设计模式","id":"类型组合设计模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"健全空安全与类型系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/type-system/sound-null-safety"},"next":{"title":"模式匹配与 Records","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/dart-language-async/type-system/pattern-matching-records"}}